{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/Forest_Keeper_Lookout_Gif_1.gif?t=1745084778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've taken a temporary job as a forest ranger, deep in the remote mountains. Your tasks are simple: clean the cabin, maintain equipment, sort trash, and monitor the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But something feels off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/Forest_Keeper_Lookout_Gif_2.gif?t=1745084778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fix broken machines, manage power systems, put out campfires, and inspect storm damage\u2014while strange noises and unexplained events slowly creep in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everything in the forest wants to be found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric, story-rich experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive tasks across different zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic weather and environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2899460?t=1745084778","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2899460?t=1745084778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/ff1400275cf1a7fe1daa00c94925f4cebf948490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745084778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/ff1400275cf1a7fe1daa00c94925f4cebf948490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745084778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/Forest_Keeper_Lookout_Gif_1.gif?t=1745084778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've taken a temporary job as a forest ranger, deep in the remote mountains. Your tasks are simple: clean the cabin, maintain equipment, sort trash, and monitor the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But something feels off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/extras/Forest_Keeper_Lookout_Gif_2.gif?t=1745084778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fix broken machines, manage power systems, put out campfires, and inspect storm damage\u2014while strange noises and unexplained events slowly creep in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everything in the forest wants to be found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric, story-rich experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive tasks across different zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic weather and environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Kizuna Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899460/eb61ce28af1f9ac6ffa9fe3a11344d947a84c94a/header.jpg?t=1745084778","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257012191,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic